  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mec 802.02 “Water treatment technician” means “water treatment technician” as defined in RSA 153:27, namely, “any person who installs maintains or repairs water treatment systems.”\n\nSource. #13632, eff 7-19-23",
